{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43391","headline":"大庆堂赐宴元璫有诗呈吴越王 · 吴越失姓名人","name":"大庆堂赐宴元璫有诗呈吴越王","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非爲亲贤展绮筵，恒常宁敢恣游盘。\n绿搓杨柳绵初软，红晕樱桃粉未乾。\n谷鸟乍啼声似涩，甘霖方霁景犹寒。\n笙歌风紧人酣醉，却遶珍丛烂熳看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴越失姓名人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}